msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"Last night, the man in this sketch shot the patriarch of the\r\n"
"Ryudo Family down in Okinawa. A guy by the name Nakahara."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "And you're sure this is what the attacker looked like?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"I didn't believe it myself at first, but the girl who\r\n"
"watched it all go down drew this afterward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"Which means the sixth chairman and this Nakahara were\r\n"
"assaulted by the same man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "The pieces are all falling into place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "Cosa intendi?"

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"More likely than not, Daigo's involvement in the Okinawa\r\n"
"deal is what led to his being attacked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "You mean the resort?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Yes. As you're well aware, the Tojo aided the Ministry of\r\n"
"Land, Infrastructure, and Transportation in acquiring the\r\n"
"land necessary to build Minister Suzuki's proposed resort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"Right, but Daigo told me you guys backed out. That the\r\n"
"government was trying to negotiate with the locals instead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"They were, but it seems someone else has started scooping up\r\n"
"the land. There must be another party involved in all this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"Speaking of, the man in that sketch didn't just shoot\r\n"
"Nakahara. He also stole the deed to his land."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "Cosa!?"

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"I'd bet the man showed up asking for the deed, then put a\r\n"
"bullet in Nakahara when he refused to hand it over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"Then it's safe to assume the assault on the sixth chairman\r\n"
"was for the same reason. Specifically for the land your\r\n"
"orphanage rests on, Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "So Daigo knows who these people are?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"In all likelihood, yes. The truth of it is, that resort deal\r\n"
"could have brought massive cashflow into the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"Minister Suzuki was eager to remind us of that fact at any\r\n"
"possible moment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "But Daigo was firm in his resolve."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "He refused? Why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"I think you know. It was because of your orphanage, Kiryu.\r\n"
"Once he learned you would be evicted and your kids would lose their home, he washed his hands of the whole thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "So he put himself in harm's way to keep us safe..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "Where is he now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Somewhere safe. I checked him into a hospital."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "Which one?"
msgstr "Quale?"

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"I think it's best you don't know. I can't have you going\r\n"
"there and risk someone following you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "You'll just have to trust me for the time being."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "...I can do that. How's he doing, though?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"Balancing on a knife's edge at the moment. The next week or so will "
"determine which way he falls."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Right..."
msgstr "Giusto..."

msgctxt "5776"
msgid "Kiryu"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5780"
msgid "Kashiwagi"
msgstr ""

